   "bridgeResponse": "'Great with Milk' is the useful observation here \u2014 it is the question every workplace and hospitality buyer actually asks, framed in plain language rather than cupping notes. Worth borrowing the framing for how Bridge presents its own range to trade buyers, without borrowing the retail tone.",
